{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A cute, chaotic game about biting your friends! Multiplayer tag with your teeth!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friends And Fangs is a chaotic, colourful multiplayer survival escape game, played in fast-paced 8-10 minute rounds, based on the idea of a playground game of tag. Rush to escape the island with your fellow \u2018fluffies\u2019 or hunt them down as the scary \u2018mutant\u2019!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THE FLUFFY</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715890/extras/4656fd91b2421091f5c974a915887dd5.avif?t=1759839108\" width=100 height=130 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace the role of the defenceless but hardworking fluffy! Gather materials, complete objectives and escape with your friends before the mutant knows what hit \u2018em!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715890/extras/0a4735babef240c21d5229ec6457a50a.avif?t=1759839108\" width=250 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluffies have 3 objectives; <strong>food</strong>, <strong>fuel </strong>and <strong>wood</strong>. All one needs to make a an escape from the island\u2014and the enemy lurking there. The fluffies may have less tools at their disposal but the in-game mechanics give them plenty of warning when a mutant is nearby.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THE MUTANT</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715890/extras/a99424eff5e1a3b35615293577f383f6.avif?t=1759839108\" width=150 height=127 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your adversary? One of your own friends, gone mad with hunger and the urge to bite\u2014the mutant. Demolish hiding spots and leap over obstacles in your hunt to consume every last fluffy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715890/extras/eed1ef60ff34eaf936e2020cc25484e2.avif?t=1759839108\" width=400 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While fluffies only have the means to run and hide, the mutant has a number of other abilities; <strong>destroy </strong>bushes that the fluffies use to hide, force the fluffies to reveal themselves with <strong>mutant breath</strong>, use the <strong>mutant vision</strong> ability to see them from a distance,\u00a0and\u00a0<strong>bite\u00a0</strong>them to injure and eventually take them out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8-10 minute rounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3-6 players (1 player as the mutant)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different objective types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mid-sized map to facilitate conflict</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 fluffy abilities and 4 additional mutant abilities</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3715890?t=1759839108","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715890/75a46d11126342c1cfa9da25a6bad3cc0f41b7fa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759839108","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715890/d4098247aa4bb4294967d9acfdb28a405cbef9c2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759839108","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715890/d409