lenty of warning when a mutant is nearby.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THE MUTANT</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715890/extras/a99424eff5e1a3b35615293577f383f6.avif?t=1759839108\" width=150 height=127 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your adversary? One of your own friends, gone mad with hunger and the urge to bite\u2014the mutant. Demolish hiding spots and leap over obstacles in your hunt to consume every last fluffy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715890/extras/eed1ef60ff34eaf936e2020cc25484e2.avif?t=1759839108\" width=400 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While fluffies only have the means to run and hide, the mutant has a number of other abilities; <strong>destroy </strong>bushes that the fluffies use to hide, force the fluffies to reveal themselves with <strong>mutant breath</strong>, use the <strong>mutant vision</strong> ability to see them from a distance,\u00a0and\u00a0<strong>bite\u00a0</strong>them to injure and eventually take them out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8-10 minute rounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3-6 players (1 player as the mutant)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different objective types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mid-sized map to facilitate conflict</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 fluffy abilities and 4 additional mutant abilities</p></li></ul>","developers":["ScaryPawsStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.aka